{
 "encounter_id": "00960",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Dr Stein, this is Mrs Dawn Pearce. Her obs: blood pressure 142 over 86, pulse 76, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 16, weight 84 kilos. She's got a screening letter and a bit of a story."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, nurse. Dawn, come in, sit down. Tell me about the letter. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, yes, lovely to see you, doctor. I got a letter from the eye screening people, and I thought, well, I'd better ask someone, because I've been seeing a bit blurry at times. Honestly, I'm so busy, and I don't know when it started."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When roughly? Last month, last year?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hmm. I couldn't say. Sometime in the summer? Or the one before?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Is the blurring in one eye or both? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Both, usually in the evening, when I'm reading. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any floaters, little dark spots?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A few, yes, drifting about. I thought it was dust."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything in your feet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tingling, yes. In the toes, mostly at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you thirsty a lot?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit more than usual. I'm always filling up my water bottle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And tired?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Always."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain in the eyes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No eye pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any sudden loss of vision, like a curtain coming down?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Flashing lights?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No flashes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medication are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Metformin, maybe 1000 mg, twice a day. I'd have to check the box."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes, for about eight years. And high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Surgery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cataract in the right eye, in 2022, and a hysterectomy in 2005."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Diabetes in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What did you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bookkeeper. Retired two years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Smoking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I swim on Mondays and Fridays."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at your feet. Take your shoes off.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Close your eyes and tell me when you feel this thin plastic fibre.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. Yes. Hm. Not that one. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You can't feel it at the big toes, so the feeling there is reduced."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The pulses at both ankles are present and strong."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Here's my thinking. Your diabetes control may be slipping, which would explain the thirst, the tiredness and the feet, but I can't rule out early diabetic changes in the eyes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh dear. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's very treatable if caught early. I'd like to arrange an HbA1c blood test, and I'd like to arrange your retinal screening photograph."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The nurse can book the photograph now. I'd also like to start atorvastatin, 20 mg, once a day, to protect your heart and blood vessels."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll book it after this, Dawn. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks, when the results are back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. I'll write it on the calendar. ~"
  }
 ],
